    {
      "text": "The Freshservice outegration workflow webhook enables automatic syncing of Freshservice ticket updates such as Status or SLA changes to their corresponding tickets, reducing the need for manual changes. This step is required when configuring the Freshservice to ticket mapping to keep Freshservice tickets and SecOps tickets in sync. To learn more, see Configuring the Freshservice Outegration."
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "text": "To set up your Freshservice workflow webhook:"
    },
